      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33b2f180ce261e7c49d2d929",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…啊，必须行动起来。\r\n只有我一直\r\n被大家甩在后面…",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e9eca777494cd0bcf8778781bfcbcc8fa3ea20693153203acfe68ce3eddf5c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d579258d3d27df5ed0a0eef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系的。\r\n我还能继续…不继续的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ed94c57c29aca709279e04d23008c36ca823473db0d32efa6a7b55a13c0d342",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc80a55802c75c8defbebc1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要尝试点新东西…？\r\n嗯，我感觉现在的我能做到…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c89cf7d7351bbab33ee1dbde2f1bf171ac442244f3a9580dbf3755dad78a0836",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fba3adb9ce46a621d4f359e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会输给任何人…\r\n至少在心情上是这样的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e0fbe44f930adedabb995063da0cf8e2694f7f6d154516747f0fec86ba177bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c2a0a0c7f22638d1bfeb5bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种感觉…如果能维持下去的话，\r\n感觉能更接近姊妹们…",
      "source_fingerprint": "51753c96648f6a25513d14babd0b9f0a093528e78ec05070cc25e6cb77a91289",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a89fbcaa5eab05a8e80ba3fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态比平时还好。\r\n不愧是训练员\r\n一教就不一样了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "26c1cf6e0d387cde15587c4fa3ab192bd6bf8be290307973aa46d4ccab0609b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc10e346222dcca1c356ecae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃…今天要做什么？\r\n我已经准备好了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "73bb5bab9162ac821b6f81738a2536232435e105ff12cfdd6ba9f03ccdd85b14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eca4f6efc981eef8c4e836c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一步一步踏实地把事情做好吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "566c39cffda9c822d37efc8a0f3bd14950ff0228655378006783ffc10c7f54b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d2941e3c06d84962d60c8fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…哈，对不起…\r\n我这样老是叹气，这不太好吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1223bcbc710190e7bd6690350615c1f976487b94fc6f7dc0d45f6a0cdeab0458",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1089",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47b0831f27d7cd71ca1fc427",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔…总感觉\r\n比平时还难有成效…",
